message:
Fix 13 defects found auditing batch 224

An independent audit of the wave-8 reconciliation (ea94d3bc3f) recounted
every operation count and remeasured the degrees; all headline numbers
held. It found wording, attribution and list defects, fixed here:

- thirteen positive is not a new slice: 57's 132 / 83 dominates wave-4
  24's 319 / 89 and the 515 / 84 equation (systems 288 / 81 and 488 / 78
  stay separate);
- 59's 2^1182967 comparison base is 52's own nine-variable base, and its
  "eighteen-stage replay" is the first 18 of its 25 stages: both removed
  from the discrepancy list;
- 56's 571-op natural form is in nine/README.md and nine/PROOF.md;
- 57's WAVE7_AUDIT labels 52's systems as shifted correctly; only 56
  drops the word;
- the stale-README observers are 55, 56, 57 and 59 (not 54);
- which packages cite the active closed equations (54, 56, 59, not 58);
- natural-domain surcharges completed (58's +15, 59's initial +4, 56's
  reference +9); five, not four, 13Z intermediates in 59;
- 55 also cites Sun's Propositions 6.1-6.2;
- 59's NO_TWELVE_VARIABLE_CLAIM counterexamples concern shortcuts in its
  13Z proof, not the twelve-variable routes;
- 59's nine-variable comparisons also bind 2^590069;
- method notes: 55's certificate is D^16 times the primary; 59's
  nine-variable and 13Z degrees now confirmed exactly; 54's nine
  distinct ten-integer polynomials depend on the actual fixed values;
  56's PDF has no metadata title; 54's missing check_short*.log names
  come from positive/README.txt.

